WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Narrator: Stay calm.

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.700
Narrator: Wait for the instruction.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:06.900
Narrator: Inside, away from glass.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.500
Narrator: Help others.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:12.700
Narrator: Stay until the all-clear.
